---
// src/components/ProjectShowcase.astro
---

<section class="py-24 bg-[#0B111E] text-white relative" id="showcase">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-400/20 text-blue-300 text-xs font-telemetry uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Proven Field Track Record
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
        Real DFW Field Audits. Real Engineering Truth.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Explore recent real-world engineering evaluations conducted across the Dallas-Fort Worth metroplex.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Column Showcase Grid (Directly Synthesized from Moodboard Image 1) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Case 01: Dallas -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between group glass-card-interactive">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-telemetry text-slate-400 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-800">
            <span>CASE #01 // DALLAS</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">PE SEALED</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">North Dallas Option Period</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4">Single-Family Slab-on-Grade (3,400 sqft)</p>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-telemetry mb-6 bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Contractor Quote:</span>
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">$24,000 (18 piers)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">FSI Diagnosis:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Sprinkler Heave ($0)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-between font-bold">
              <span class="text-white">Client Saved:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">$24,000</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Digital manometer survey verified floor deflection was due to plumbing moisture, avoiding unnecessary foundation underpinning.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 02: Fort Worth -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between group glass-card-interactive">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-telemetry text-slate-400 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-800">
            <span>CASE #02 // FT WORTH</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">PE SEALED</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Historic Pier & Beam Audit</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4">1948 Crawlspace Structure</p>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-telemetry mb-6 bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Contractor Quote:</span>
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">$16,500 (full lift)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">FSI Diagnosis:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Subfloor Girder ($2,300)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-between font-bold">
              <span class="text-white">Client Saved:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">$14,200</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Physical audit identified localized rotted wood beam causing floor bounce rather than perimeter foundation failure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 03: Plano -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between group glass-card-interactive">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-telemetry text-slate-400 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-800">
            <span>CASE #03 // PLANO</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">PE SEALED</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">New Construction Pre-Pour</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4">Custom Residential Post-Tension</p>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-telemetry mb-6 bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Builder Status:</span>
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">Ready to Pour</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">FSI Finding:</span>
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">Misplaced Tendons</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-between font-bold">
              <span class="text-white">Outcome:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">Corrected Pre-Pour</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Inspection caught post-tension cable sagging before concrete was poured, preventing future structural slab failure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 04: Frisco -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between group glass-card-interactive">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-telemetry text-slate-400 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-800">
            <span>CASE #04 // FRISCO</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">PE SEALED</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Commercial Due Diligence</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4">18,000 sqft Retail Center</p>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-telemetry mb-6 bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Timeline:</span>
              <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">48-Hour Loan Window</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Deliverable:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">SBA Certified PE Stamped</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 flex justify-between font-bold">
              <span class="text-white">Turnaround:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">Same-Day</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Expedited commercial structural report approved by lender underwriters without slowing transaction closing.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
